Action:
  - move: ?a - loc ?b - loc
      pre: (and (at ?a) (conn ?a ?b))
      eff: (and (at ?b) (increase (total-cost) 1.5) (not (at ?a)))
  + move: ?a - loc ?b - loc
      pre: (and (at ?a) (conn ?a ?b))
      eff: (and (at ?b) (increase (total-cost) 3) (not (at ?a)))
Func prop:
  - (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg
  + (total-cost): in_init init_all_nonneg init_all_nonpos init_all_int in_metric is_metric_alone in_eff write_delta_nonneg write_delta_nonneg_int
